<title>USA: USDA adds $3 mln in veg oil to Congo PL480 pact.</title>
<headline>USDA adds $3 mln in veg oil to Congo PL480 pact.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday it added $3 million worth of vegetable oil to a PL 480 sales agreement with Congo.</p>
<p>In addition, USDA said the pact also was amended to switch $5 million worth of vegetable oil to $5 million worth of rice.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal year 1996.</p>
</text>
